    "created_at": "2016-08-04T05:24:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-04T05:24:49Z",
    "body": "I feel like we definitely shouldn't add more input types; that hasn't gone super-well in the past. But some kind of revised inputmode proposal that implementers were actually interested in would make sense to me. @mounirlamouri and I have talked about such a thing in the past.\n",
