    "created_at": "2016-08-05T06:55:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-05T06:56:01Z",
    "body": "I am @grimreaper. I proposed \"digit\" as an \"inputmode\", not as a type.\nIn particular there are a large number of cases where only digits are acceptable, but the type isn't a number per se. For example credit card values, CVV values, TOTP codes, etc.\n",
