    "created_at": "2016-08-05T07:05:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-05T07:05:06Z",
    "body": "more generally, being able to control the keyboard presented is a valuable feature, and a large part of the user experience. While I'd love to see advanced types used (and be re-implemented, poorly, less) there is clear evidence that UX designers care about the keyboard.\nThe present version of how this is done is a \"hack\" of using the pattern \\d*.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
