    "created_at": "2017-09-27T12:13:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-27T12:13:25Z",
    "body": "In theory `inputmode=numeric` addresses this, though note that nobody implements this and we plan on removing it in #3077.\r\n\r\nIn practice you can use `pattern=[0-9]+`. We should maybe encourage that user agents adapt their UI based on the attribute value given that they're doing that already?",
